 58	       The fragment is carried explicitly. A browser keeps it across the worker's 302 and 308 by
 59	       itself, but a script navigation does not, so without this a first visit to `/#/docs` landed
 60	       on `/<default>/` while every later visit landed on `/<default>/#/docs`. */
